From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] http: verify resumed transfers with If-Range

Store bounded HTTP validators in a backwards-readable optional control-file
extension. Commit cleared progress before restarting a changed transfer and
discard the old connections before accepting any body from the new entity.
